    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a PhD in chemistry, so I’ve worked with mathematical models in lab settings. I don’t see math as a separate subject but as a tool—like a language for describing nature. I’m not a mathematician by training, but I use equations daily in research. My relationship with math is practical, not theoretical.",
